x; height:34px; vertical-align:bottom; display:inline-block; max-height:250px; max-width:250px\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/thumb/1200/_b23db780c445c9b200b54b175eb1ac74-png.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd id=\"x_TextCell_14829527592350.7373816356039664\" style=\"padding:0px; vertical-align:top; display:table-cell\" colspan=\"2\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"LPRemovePreviewContainer_14829527592350.5878246704456542\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"LPTitle_14829527592350.3242446865408466\" style=\"top:0px; color:rgb(67,33,88); line-height:21px; font-family:\u0026quot;wf_segoe-ui_light\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Light\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe WP Light\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe WP\u0026quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:21px; font-weight:400\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Link: https://gyazo.com/bf7e4c32f4cb2c885cd72bb786fc105c\" id=\"LPUrlAnchor_14829527592370.9869731678924352\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://gyazo.com/bf7e4c32f4cb2c885cd72bb786fc105c\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eGyazo\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"LPMetadata_14829527592370.10875853339607921\" style=\"margin:10px 0px 16px; color:rgb(102,102,102); line-height:14px; font-family:\u0026quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe WP\u0026quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:400\"\u003egyazo.com\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"LPDescription_14829527592380.11227384293739795\" style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102); line-height:20px; overflow:hidden; font-family:\u0026quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe WP\u0026quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; display:block; max-height:100px\"\u003eproperty=\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eMy Ban appeal : \u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eIGN NAME : Blackware \u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003emod who banned me : resepignev\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI joined this server for the first time after a month or so,\u003cbr\u003e so I join and I ask for the donators to leave so i can join and then they join\u003cbr\u003e back because the server was full. Suddenly someone calls me a \"N****R\" and says my\u003cbr\u003e name is racist. I've had this name for years and played a lot before on this server and\u003cbr\u003e the moderator banned me for racism. I didn't say a single thing.\u003cbr\u003e I don't understand why I got banned.\u003cbr\u003e How is my name Racist ?\" \u003cbr\u003e I think the moderator banned the wrong person and i think he wanted to ban the person who called me a n*gger word\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;PROOF I DIDNT SAY ANYTHING WRONG AND THE MODERATOR FALSE BANS AND I'M STILL BANNED AFTER\u0026nbsp; 20 MINUTES : \u003ca title=\"Link: https://gyazo.com/45ed1f408b4f298f9c71d5022fd80aa6\" href=\"https://gyazo.com/45ed1f408b4f298f9c71d5022fd80aa6\"\u003ehttps://gyazo.com/45ed1f408b4f298f9c71d5022fd80aa6\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eAfter this the guy called me a N*gger.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003ch2 style=\" font-family: Lato, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;  color: rgb(51, 51, 51); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; \"\u003eStaff Complaint Format\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cb\u003eStaff Members Username: resepignev\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eReason of complaint: False ban\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eExplanation (of what he/she is doing wrong): She false banned me,\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eEvidence: Look down for screenshots\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eSince i get an error when trying to make an unban appeal i'll post it here : \u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e