alled me a n*gger word\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;PROOF I DIDNT SAY ANYTHING WRONG AND THE MODERATOR FALSE BANS AND I'M STILL BANNED AFTER\u0026nbsp; 20 MINUTES : \u003ca title=\"Link: https://gyazo.com/45ed1f408b4f298f9c71d5022fd80aa6\" href=\"https://gyazo.com/45ed1f408b4f298f9c71d5022fd80aa6\"\u003ehttps://gyazo.com/45ed1f408b4f298f9c71d5022fd80aa6\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eAfter this the guy called me a N*gger.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","created_at":1482953513,"title":"Ban Appeal Not working -500 error.","replies":[{"id":349457,"author":"resepignev","body":"Heeya Blackware,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFirst of all don't worry about your name. It's fine and you won't get punished for it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd second, I'm sorry for the ban, it was an mistake on my side. I thought, you were the one saying these racial slurs, yet after looking at the chatlogs again your name was mentioned with the slur in the same messaged. For me it looked like you sent the message.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe person that initially called you \"nigger\" has been banned. And your ban is already removed. I hope it didn't cause any other inconveniences than not being able to play on the server.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHopefully you can forgive my mistake.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards Flo/resepignev","body_tagged":"Heeya Blackware,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFirst of all don't worry about your name. It's fine and you won't get punished for it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd second, I'm sorry for the ban, it was an mistake on my side. I thought, you were the one saying these racial slurs, yet after looking at the chatlogs again your name was mentioned with the slur in the same messaged. For me it looked like you sent the message.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe person that initially called you \"nigger\" has been banned. And your ban is already removed. I hope it didn't cause any other inconveniences than not being able to play on the server.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHopefully you can forgive my mistake.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards Flo/resepignev","created_at":1482960779}]}